# Core Business Rules

## SLA Engine (penalty-critical)

- Differentiate corrective-maintenance resolution by location: `Dalam kota`, `Luar kota`, `Luar pulau`
- **Dalam kota + VIP + peak hours (06.01–21.00):** hard **2-hour** resolution window
- Auto-escalate / flag at **80%** of SLA elapsed (e.g. Warning at 1h36m for a 2h limit); mark Breached when past deadline
- Keep SLA thresholds and peak-hour windows in config/DB — not magic numbers in UI or handlers

## Vendor performance

- Track multi-vendor metrics: allocation, deployments, SLA compliance
- Score against **99.9%** uptime target via daily/period metric logs

## Buffer stock (logistics)

- Maintain **≥10%** buffer stock per Regional Office (RO)
- Alert when stock is below threshold or idle units should be pooled/redistributed
- Mutation history must record deploy / recall / transfer / pooling status changes
